GET http://localhost:8080/products/1

> {%
    client.log(JSON.stringify(response.body, null, 2));
%}

### 9. Product with a future price shows todays price
GET http://localhost:8080/products/5

> {%
    client.log(JSON.stringify(response.body, null, 2));
